-- Astronauta: el traje salía como un buzo blanco liso. Se describen los detalles de un
-- traje espacial real (anillo de metal en el cuello, panel de control, mangueras,
-- parches, guantes) y el casco en la mano, para que la cara siga visible.
UPDATE public.ai_themes SET prompt = 'Edit this photo. Keep every person exactly as they are: same face, facial features, skin tone, age, body shape, hairstyle and expression, so each one is instantly recognizable. Do not add, remove or merge people, and keep their poses. Dress them in bulky, realistic white NASA-style space suits: thick layered fabric, a large metal neck ring, a rectangular chest control panel with buttons and small lights, life-support hoses, blank mission patches on the shoulders, pockets and white gloves; one of them holds a space helmet with a golden visor under the arm, so all faces stay fully visible. Replace the background with the gray surface of the Moon with craters, a lunar lander behind them and the blue Earth rising in a black starry sky. Relight the people to match the new scene (same light direction, color and warmth) and use a shallow depth of field with a softly blurred background, so the result looks like one real professional photo taken there, not a collage. Photorealistic, high detail. No text, no logos, no watermark.'
WHERE name = 'Astronauta';
